  "title": "Docebo Partners with TEDAI Vienna as The Business Learning Partner for Europe’s Inaugural AI Conference | Docebo",
  "summary": "TORONTO–(BUSINESS WIRE)– Docebo Inc. (Nasdaq:DCBO; TSX:DCBO) (” Docebo ” or the ” Company “), a global leader in AI-powered learning platforms, is proud to announce its partnership with TEDAI for the highly anticipated TEDAI Vienna event. Docebo will serve as the official business learning partner for the conference, which will take place from October 17-19, 2024, in Vienna, […]",
